The JavaScript in this directory that implements `@raycast/api` (api.js,
clipboard.js, components.js, environment.js, host-config.js, host.js, icons.js,
navigation.js, protocol.js, reconciler.js, storage.js, toast.js) is adapted
from Nanolight's Raycast host.

